{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25a0 Action Puzzle Game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The rules of this game are incredibly simple:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All you need to do is guide the characters to the goal by giving them instructions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, each stage is filled with various traps and obstacles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the available actions to overcome these challenges and lead the characters to their destination!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25a0 Action Commands That Shape the Game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1. Jump</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Avoid low steps or narrow gaps by jumping.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462110/extras/84af2b2af834ec4aa7db345ff409aaca.poster.avif?t=1759108580\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462110/extras/84af2b2af834ec4aa7db345ff409aaca.webm?t=1759108580\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462110/extras/84af2b2af834ec4aa7db345ff409aaca.mp4?t=1759108580\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2. Vertical Drill</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drill vertically through yellow blocks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462110/extras/86b6580ba3caa92a73b6c0f0b66a048c.poster.avif?t=1759108580\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462110/extras/86b6580ba3caa92a73b6c0f0b66a048c.webm?t=1759108580\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462110/extras/86b6580ba3caa92a73b6c0f0b66a048c.mp4?t=1759108580\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3. Horizontal Drill</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drill horizontally through yellow blocks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462110/extras/15acd7a574271c00a70c639a538ca36b.poster.avif?t=1759108580\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462110/extras/15acd7a574271c00a70c639a538ca36b.webm?t=1759108580\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462110/extras/15acd7a574271c00a70c639a538ca36b.mp4?t=1759108580\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4. Hardening</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Transform into a block to obstruct other characters' progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462110/extras/117be22e57f9183ba95629cd57148b94.poster.avif?t=1759108580\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462110/extras/117be22e57f9183ba95629cd57148b94.webm?t=1759108580\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462110/extras/117be22e57f9183ba95629cd57148b94.mp4?t=1759108580\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5. Flower</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A flower blooms on the character, slowing their fall.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They won't break even after falling from high places.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462110/extras/373bd4f103d414ddb94e5f709fc38f80.poster.avif?t=1759108580\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462110/extras/373bd4f103d414ddb94e5f709fc38f80.webm?t=1759108580\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462110/extras/373bd4f103d414ddb94e5f709fc38f80.mp4?t=1759108580\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6. Spin</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The character spins and moves at high speed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462110/extras/b3d873ad34f669da4e69984779dc5bd4.poster.avif?t=1759108580\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462110/extras/b3d873ad34f669da4e69984779dc5bd4.webm?t=1759108580\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462110/extras/b3d873ad34f669da4e69984779dc5bd4.mp4?t=1759108580\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >7. Wall Climbing</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The character gains the ability to climb walls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462110/extras/a4131b5ff16b97ac660270f427a6004b.poster.avif?t=1759108580\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462110/extras/a4131b5ff16b97ac660270f427a6004b.webm?t=1759108580\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462110/extras/a4131b5ff16b97ac660270f427a6004b.mp4?t=1759108580\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >8. Floor Creation</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create floors over open gaps.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can build up to four floors with a single action.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462110/extras/c2e6637bb9aaaef10c49fa567004ed7c.poster.avif?t=1759108580\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462110/extras/c2e6637bb9aaaef10c49fa567004ed7c.webm?t=1759108580\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462110/extras/c2e6637bb9aaaef10c49fa567004ed7c.mp4?t=1759108580\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25a0 Soundtrack Created by Suno, the AI Music Generator</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy a variety of tracks created using Suno, a state-of-the-art AI music generator.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be amazed by the cutting-edge technology and the exceptional quality of these compositions!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3462110?t=1759108580","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462110/page_bg_raw